    <description>Inbound Omni-Channel flow for the Web Chat messaging channel: creates a Case for every new chat, links it to the Messaging Session, then routes the session to the Nova Support Agent (Agentforce Service Agent). If the Case cannot be created, the chat goes straight to Chat Support Queue.</description>
